OL,3,GNEWSARapist jailed after admitting
OL,4,Aattack on woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rapist has been jailed for more than
OL,7,Feight years.
OL,9,FPhill Blunt, from Scarborough, was due
OL,10,Fto stand trial for the offence in July
OL,11,Fbut changed his plea at the last
OL,12,Fmoment, according to North Yorkshire
OL,13,FPolice.
OL,15,FA force spokesperson said the victim
OL,16,Fhad been preparing to give evidence in
OL,17,Fcourt following a "long-running
OL,18,Finvestigation".
OL,20,FBlunt, 39, was sentenced to eight years
OL,21,Fand six months in prison during a
OL,22,Fhearing at York Crown Court on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
